<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June broad money M3 up 21.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June broad money M3 up 21.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 21.9 percent year-on-year in June, against 20.3 percent in May, the central Bank Negara said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 30 percent at the end of June against 29.5 percent at the end of May, it said.  </p>
<p>	   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	    June 97	   May 97	 June 96</p>
<p>  M1	 15.5	     10.0	    11.7</p>
<p>  M2	 21.3	     18.3	    21.6</p>
<p>  M3	 21.9	     20.3	    22.9</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
